        <p>ABOUT ME</p>

        <h2>Get To Know Me</h2>

        <span>
            A brief introduction about my journey and interests.
        </span>

    </div>


    <div class="about-grid">

        <div class="about-text">

            <h3>BCA Student & Future Developer</h3>

            <p>
                I'm Ayush Srivastava, a Bachelor of Computer Applications
                student with a strong interest in software development,
                programming and technology.
            </p>

            <p>
                I enjoy learning programming languages such as Java and Python
                and developing websites using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
            </p>

            <p>
                My goal is to continuously improve my technical and
                problem-solving skills and start my career in the software
                development industry.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-info">

            <div class="info-box">
                <span>🎓</span>
                <div>
                    <small>Degree</small>
                    <strong>Bachelor of Computer Applications</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <span>💻</span>
                <div>
                    <small>Interest</small>
                    <strong>Software Development</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <span>📍</span>
                <div>
                    <small>Location</small>
                    <strong>Prayagraj, Uttar Pradesh, India</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <span>🚀</span>
                <div>
                    <small>Status</small>
                    <strong>Open to Opportunities</strong>
